    "language": "eng",
    "description": "Albert Gallatin, 1761-1849, Secretary of the Treasury under Presidents Jefferson and Madison.--Johann August Roebling, 1806-1869, bridge builder.--John Peter Altgeld, 1847-1902, Governor of Illinois.--Abraham Jacobi, 1830-1919, physician.--Edwin Lawrence Godkin, 1831-1902, editor of the Nation and the New York evening post.--Johann Most, 1846-1906, labor agitator.--Nikola Tesla, 1856-1943, electrical genius.--Anton Julius Carlson, 1875-1856, physiologist.--Ole Edvart Rölvaag, 1876-1931, author.--Selman Abraham Waksman, 1888- microbiologist.--David Dubinsky, 1892- labor leader.--Herman Badillo, 1929- Congressman from New York.--Bibliography (p. 275-276)",
